@page "/"

<PageTitle>Dashboard - BillFoundry</PageTitle>

<section class="page-header">
    <h1>Dashboard</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        BillFoundry is a freelance invoicing application. This Community Edition is currently at
        Phase 0: the solution foundation is in place, and invoicing features have not been added yet.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="foundation-heading">
    <h2 id="foundation-heading">Current foundation</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Modular .NET 10 solution with Domain, Application, Infrastructure, and Web projects</li>
        <li>EF Core and SQL Server configured without business entities</li>
        <li>Health checks at <code>/health</code> and <code>/health/ready</code></li>
        <li>Centralized exception handling and structured logging</li>
    </ul>
</section>
